1
00:00:01,220 --> 00:00:04,400
Here's the original shot,
and here's the AI edit.

2
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:08,940
The car looks good,
but the framing has shifted a little.

3
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:12,340
PlateLock is there to line it back up.

4
00:00:13,420 --> 00:00:15,380
You load both clips in ComfyUI,

5
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:17,740
check the match and run the repair.

6
00:00:19,820 --> 00:00:22,120
Then, with an LTX AlphaGen mask,

7
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:26,060
you can keep the new car
and bring back the original background.

8
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:34,900
This is the actual AI output.

9
00:00:35,980 --> 00:00:39,100
Its timing slips midway through.

10
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:42,020
PlateLock realigns it,

11
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:45,560
and with RIFE, you can fill in the gaps.

12
00:00:46,420 --> 00:00:50,120
The AI take in this example
is eight seconds.

13
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:51,980
The edit needs nine.

14
00:00:52,740 --> 00:00:54,660
LTX keeps the original frames

15
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:56,600
and generates the extra second.

16
00:00:58,440 --> 00:00:59,660
That's PlateLock.

17
00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:03,100
The AI edit,
lined up with your original shot.

18
00:01:04,100 --> 00:01:04,520
Thank you.
